Package: geneRosetta
Title: Gene Annotation Retrieval and Mapping Utilities
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Alexandros", "Karagiannopoulos", , "alexandros.karagiannopoulos@med.lu.se", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reliable Gene Annotation Mapping. Retrieve, cache, and merge human, mouse, and rat gene annotations
    from Ensembl BioMart, NCBI, and organism-specific authorities (HGNC, MGI,
    RGD); map between gene symbols and stable identifiers with synonym-aware
    matching and configurable multi-mapping resolution.
